{
  "id": "section-327",
  "title": "对民建方针指示的精神",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-030.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>030)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　一、私人资本在中国建设上是有贡献的，只要不让它向坏的方面发展。<br>\n<br>\n　　二、不能让资本家光是图私人的利，必须兼顾国家的利，工人的利。<br>\n<br>\n　　三、很好的团结他们、教育他们、改造他们，先学习并实行共同纲领。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-029.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-031.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
